+64 KB LDS/CU, 8 MB L2), 2350 MHz. Model: `/llm/models/Qwen3.5/4B/StewFP8/
+stewfp8-ow.gguf` (24 delta-net layers, H=32 heads, K=V=128, neqk1=16).
