+  rewrite gets the same win with zero risk to the GEMM path.
+- Files: fp8.cuh (quantize_fp8_warp template), fp8.cu (dispatch).
+- Validation: /tmp/bench_fused.cu + /tmp/bench_pairs.cu (rigs), /tmp/fp8_cvt_test.cu
