+BUG FOUND (do not rediscover): the repack kernel looped `r < gridDim.y`
+instead of `r < m`. For m > 65535 (output.weight, vocab 152064) grid.y is
+clamped to 65535, so rows beyond 65535 were never repacked -> garbage logits
